 61TI    TA(86KR,X):T1/2:XUNDL-1       2011DA08                           201106
 61TI c  Compiled (unevaluated) data set from 2011Da08:                         
 61TI2c  Phys Rev C 83, 054312 (2011)                                           
 61TI c  Compiled by M. Birch and B. Singh (McMaster); May 19 {I2011}.          
 61TI c  {+61}Ti produced in the fragmentation of 57.8 MeV/nucleon {+86}Kr      
 61TI2c  beam impinged on 50 mg/cm{+2} thick tantalum target using LISE-2000    
 61TI3c  spectrometer at GANIL facility. Detector system included a             
 61TI4c  three-element Si-detector telescope containing a double-sided          
 61TI5c  silicon-strip detector (DSSSD) backed by a Si(Li) detector and         
 61TI6c  surrounded by four clover type EXOGAM Ge detectors. Product            
 61TI7c  identified by mass, atomic number, charge, energy loss and time of     
 61TI8c  flight. Measured half-life.                                            
 61TI  L 0                               15 MS     4                            
 61TI cL T$ based on time correlation between implantation and |b-ray events    
 61TI2cL in the DSSSD. Fitting procedure included five parameters: |b-detection 
 61TI3cL efficiency, background rate, mother, daughter and granddaughter        
 61TI4cL half-lives (2011Da08)                                                  
                                                                                
